`rtdata/data/uhs_cusp_data.json` (the per-cube matrices `mu`).

For the cube `a : Fin 48` of `Work.Cusp.Data` (matched by cusp, ideal vertex and lower corner),
`chartMat a` is a positive integer multiple of the inverse `mu_a^{-1}` of the JSON matrix `mu_a`.
The UHS chart of the cube is

  `chartKlein a q = kleinOfHyp (chartMat a * hypOfUHS q)`,

whose restriction to the truncation facet (the ceiling of the cube) is the affine map
`Work.Cusp.cubeXToKlein a` of the cube (this is checked numerically; see the certificates).

Do not edit by hand.
